              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The Bishop has a hand weapon, heavy armour and shield. May ride a warhorse (+16). Any unit led by a Bishop may re-roll failed Panic tests.</characteristic>
