              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A standard bearer has a hand weapon, heavy armour and shield. Army Standard Bearer. May ride a warhorse (+16) The Army Standard may be upgraded to the True Cross (+30). Any unit led by the True Cross becomes Stubborn.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
